<title>USA: Echlin names Larry McCurdy president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Echlin names Larry McCurdy president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BRANFORD, Conn. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Echlin Inc said on Friday that Larry McCurdy was elected president, chief executive officer, and a director.</p>
<p>McCurdy was previously executive vice president of operations for the Automotive Products segment of Cooper Industries Inc, Echlin said.</p>
<p>Echlin chairman Trevor Jones held the positions on an interim basis after the retirement of Frederick Mancheski, the company said on February 21, 1997.</p>
